// the neighbour's CELL and the direction at it that points back here, plus
// the register/mirror select: a defect push is a datapath OUTPUT of the
// NEIGHBOUR (the flat array's `pe_push[NBR][REV]`), because `push` follows
// the pointer the neighbour computes THIS cycle, not the one in its
