// Reset value of a cell's packed state: cid = identity's id, whole = 1,
// everything else 0.
// Layout {cid, active, whole, defect, ptr, grown, unrooted, busy} means
// cid sits at bit (6 + PTR_W) and whole at (4 + PTR_W) -- a fixed `<< 7`
// is only correct when PTR_W == 1, and getting it wrong leaves the cid's
